WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:02.435
-Good evening, everybody.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.435 --> 00:00:03.803
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.803 --> 00:00:05.605
And now if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:05.605 --> 00:00:08.341
The House voted last week
to pass legislation

00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:10.743
protecting same-sex marriages,

00:00:10.743 --> 00:00:12.278
because everyone deserves

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:14.948
the right to be
secretly unhappy.

00:00:14.948 --> 00:00:18.150
[ Laughter ]

00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:20.119
According to a new report,

00:00:20.119 --> 00:00:21.754
the Biden administration
isn't worried

00:00:21.754 --> 00:00:24.223
about Elon Musk's
ownership of Twitter

00:00:24.223 --> 00:00:26.192
and doesn't view the platform

00:00:26.192 --> 00:00:28.627
as being a vital part
of its political strategy.

00:00:28.627 --> 00:00:32.799
Said Biden, "The future of
campaigning is buttons."

00:00:32.799 --> 00:00:35.068
[ Laughter ]

00:00:35.068 --> 00:00:38.337
According to a new poll,
37% of Republicans say

00:00:38.337 --> 00:00:40.473
they don't want
former President Trump

00:00:40.473 --> 00:00:43.276
to run in 2024,
so Trump's gonna take that hint

00:00:43.276 --> 00:00:45.979
and just continue to run
for 2020.

00:00:45.979 --> 00:00:48.247
[ Laughter ]

00:00:48.247 --> 00:00:50.049
Before announcing
his Senate run,

00:00:50.049 --> 00:00:52.552
Republican consultants
reportedly hired a law firm

00:00:52.552 --> 00:00:55.087
to compile a 500-page dossier

00:00:55.087 --> 00:00:57.556
on Georgia Senate candidate
Herschel Walker.

00:00:57.556 --> 00:01:00.326
It was just
the names of his kids.

00:01:00.326 --> 00:01:03.263
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.263 --> 00:01:07.000
Oh, sure, now that he lost,
we're all sensitive.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:10.870
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:12.505
During a speech on Saturday

00:01:12.505 --> 00:01:15.741
at the New York Young Republican
Club's annual gala,

00:01:15.741 --> 00:01:18.277
Georgia Congresswoman
Marjorie Taylor Greene

00:01:18.277 --> 00:01:19.946
complained
about liberal policies

00:01:19.946 --> 00:01:23.382
and said, "You can pick up
a butt plug or a dildo

00:01:23.382 --> 00:01:25.552
at Target nowadays."

00:01:25.552 --> 00:01:28.020
Or more likely,
you go in to buy a dildo

00:01:28.020 --> 00:01:31.224
and end up leaving with a
bunch of stuff you didn't need.

00:01:31.224 --> 00:01:35.161
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.161 --> 00:01:36.896
That's how they get ya.

00:01:36.896 --> 00:01:39.999
"Wait in the car, kids.
I'll be right back."

00:01:39.999 --> 00:01:41.500
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:43.803
Arizona Senator Kyrsten Sinema
announced last week

00:01:43.803 --> 00:01:45.304
that she's leaving
the Democratic Party

00:01:45.304 --> 00:01:46.906
and registering
as an independent

00:01:46.906 --> 00:01:48.841
because if there's one thing
she's desperate,

00:01:48.841 --> 00:01:51.377
it's for people to think
she's "indie."

00:01:51.377 --> 00:01:53.512
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.512 --> 00:01:55.715
That's right,
Arizona Senator Kyrsten Sinema

00:01:55.715 --> 00:01:57.549
announced that she's leaving
the Democratic Party.

00:01:57.549 --> 00:02:00.086
No word on what kind of party
she's going to.

00:02:00.086 --> 00:02:02.522
I'm gonna say a Muppet rave?

00:02:02.522 --> 00:02:05.291
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:07.693
The federal government
is set to run out of money

00:02:07.693 --> 00:02:09.161
on Friday at midnight.

00:02:09.161 --> 00:02:11.697
But it was worth it
for those Taylor Swift tickets.

00:02:11.697 --> 00:02:14.167
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:14.167 --> 00:02:15.935
[ Chuckles ]

00:02:15.935 --> 00:02:18.571
Archaeologists in Florida
believe they've discovered

00:02:18.571 --> 00:02:22.174
a shipwreck from the 1800s
in the sand of Daytona Beach.

00:02:22.174 --> 00:02:24.810
It's surprising because
normally all you find there

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:26.679
are train wrecks.

00:02:26.679 --> 00:02:29.815
[ Laughter ]

00:02:29.815 --> 00:02:32.185
"Take this picture.

00:02:32.185 --> 00:02:34.520
I promise they'll never use it
in a late-night talk show."

00:02:34.520 --> 00:02:37.122
[ Laughter ]

00:02:37.122 --> 00:02:40.326
Comedian Dave Chappelle
brought Elon Musk up onstage

00:02:40.326 --> 00:02:42.194
during a show last night
in San Francisco.

00:02:42.194 --> 00:02:44.230
You mean, San Francisco,

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:45.965
where a bunch of tech people
live?

00:02:45.965 --> 00:02:48.034 line:0%
How did that go?

00:02:50.269 --> 00:02:51.670 line:0%
-Don't say nothing.

00:02:51.670 --> 00:02:55.207
-It's like bringing Mel Gibson
onstage at the Apollo.

00:02:55.207 --> 00:02:57.243
They don't like you there.

00:02:57.243 --> 00:02:59.211
[ Laughter ]

00:02:59.211 --> 00:03:02.181
And finally, Bloomberg News
published an op-ed last week

00:03:02.181 --> 00:03:04.651
titled "We Have to Talk
About Adolf Hitler,"

00:03:04.651 --> 00:03:07.287
which was also
the least-popular song

00:03:07.287 --> 00:03:09.288
on the "Encanto" soundtrack.

00:03:09.288 --> 00:03:12.425
[ Laughter ]

00:03:15.227 --> 00:03:17.230
That was the monologue,
everybody.

